extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DdakP-U8jCoQ7kNvwEN0q6d&_nc_oc=AdpgwWQtMeumghZ8Rh1xI7u33vK0lzx77cUEsc2Ike_lczX1CSQ4OoUwR9lZNw-tGEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPiFiljKNHWxGOBEOqVptfX-BVAwnodnbVt0vUsp_-k-Q&oe=6AC26ED6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aiXn45ZDAakQ7kNvwGtm31r&_nc_oc=Adq9PF1IeORR00zNc3cW0c3dPV2jGIlCvA87Kagwu4_fxPQy3U0tkwk0dvNIf2C8gP8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOkwOi7tVjaF5AopSnFBerGQuQMCZiq0c4NMTf-P5FYgA&oe=6AC27622"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=erAH7z5ZcEEQ7kNvwHp7Jl4&_nc_oc=AdoK1S_WRy7XWeq5s-ybR8gLrnL3VCDpRU3HcEIUlKb0SbA9ixAvVO26hWrOfRWH1W8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM5P9UXFijbJkz4qPFkaDcGaVDRvpjl7rHDpc4rPiNOlw&oe=6AC27E19"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":